\[ = \sqrt{30 - \sqrt{30 - \sqrt{25}}} \]
\[ = \sqrt{30 - \sqrt{30 - 5}} \]
\[ = \sqrt{30 - \sqrt{25}} \]
\[ = \sqrt{30 - 5} \]
\[ = \sqrt{25} \]
\[ = 5 \]

Since the equation holds true for \(x = 30\), the solution is confirmed correct.

